00:37:22.466 --> 00:37:29.066
Merav Yuravlivker: They tend to get more set in their habits and if they can catch somebody during that stage, they tend to be more loyal customers,

00:37:29.066 --> 00:37:35.699
Merav Yuravlivker: throughout their life so in order to do that they had their data scientists if you're about to to,

00:37:35.700 --> 00:37:44.566
Merav Yuravlivker: To multiple years of data to better understand Okay, which is our customers became pregnant and then, what are the key factors there,

00:37:44.566 --> 00:37:57.332
Merav Yuravlivker: That they can use to then predict, who will become pregnant, so they did this analysis and, at the end of this analysis they found some key indicators included on buying ginger ale to help with nausea,

00:37:57.333 --> 00:38:06.299
